.TH OMNI-EXEC 1 "October 2026" "omni-term-ai" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
omni-exec \\- run a command with harness API keys injected
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omni-exec
.I command
.RI [ args... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads stored harness keys and then execs
.I command .
A key that was never stored is left unset, so an ambient token is not
replaced by an empty string.
.PP
Injected names:
.BR XAI_API_KEY ,
.BR DEEPSEEK_API_KEY ,
.BR ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ,
.BR OPENAI_API_KEY ,
.BR GH_TOKEN ,
.BR GITHUB_TOKEN ,
.BR GEMINI_API_KEY ,
.BR AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR omni-secret (1),
.BR omni-config (1),
.BR launch-ai-workspace (1)
